{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:51:49+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:51:49+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Close Brothers Group plc","sector":"Financial Services","industry":"Banks - Regional","country":"United Kingdom","city":"London","website":"https://www.closebrothers.com","employees":2537,"summary":"Close Brothers Group plc, a banking company, engages in the provision of lending and deposit taking in the United Kingdom. It operates through three segments: Commercial, Retail, and Property. The company offers asset finance; finance for new and pre-owned aircraft, commercial vessels, and leisure boats; Loan, leasing and hire purchase finance options for optical, veterinary, dental, accountancy, legal, pharmacy, medical, and funeral sectors; and broker solutions. It also provides fast short-term and bridging finance for residential and commercial property acquisitions; commercial finance; invoice finance and asset based lending for SMEs and large businesses; Novitas loans; property finance; and vehicle solutions, including vehicle rental, contract hire, finance solutions, and fleet management services. In addition, the company offers motor finance; premium finance; and savings solutions. Close Brothers Group plc was founded in 1878 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","exchange":"LSE","currency":"GBp","financial_currency":"GBP","summary_fr":"Close Brothers Group plc, une société bancaire, se livre à la fourniture de prêts et de dépôts au Royaume-Uni. Il opère à travers trois segments: commercial, de détail et de l'immobilier. La société offre des services de financement d'actifs; des services de financement pour les avions neufs et d'occasion, les navires commerciaux et les bateaux de plaisance; des options de prêt, de location et de financement d'achat pour les secteurs optique, vétérinaire, dentaire, comptable, juridique, pharma